## Interface: 30300
## Title: Dungeon Journal
## Notes: A retail-style dungeon journal: every dungeon and raid with its bosses, their abilities, loot with drop chances and the instance's quests with your progress. Shift-J or /dj. Backed by the mod-forever-dungeon-journal server module.
